    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>6</mn><mn>16</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>44</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>484</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>6</mn><mn>16</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>We know</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>6</mn><mn>16</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><m